Terraform-- A code tool to define both cloud and on-prem resources in human-readable format
        - Helps you keep track of infrustructure
        - Easier to collaborate
        - Can pass a terraform file and recreate projects etc
        - Makes sure you remove resources when you're done to avoid being charged for things

    What is it not?
        - Doesn't manage code or update it
        - Doesn't change resources (i.e. different virtual machine or change S3 buckets)
        - Doesn't manage resources not defined in your terraform file
    What is it?
        - Infrastructure as code